OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers at
OL,6,Ffirst, heavy in places, but these
OL,7,Fdying out through the evening.
OL,8,FRemaining cloudy overnight with more
OL,9,Fshowers moving up from the south.
OL,10,FMainly light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,13,Fmorning with just isolated showers.
OL,14,FThe showers developing more widely for
OL,15,Fa time in the afternoon, heavy in
OL,16,Fplaces, then dying out. Feeling warm.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
